  "ingredients": [
    "2 pounds Granny Smith apples - peeled, cored and thinly sliced",
    "0.75 cup cranberries",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "1 tablespoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "0.33333334326744 cup quick-cooking oats",
    "0.33333334326744 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 cup packed light brown sugar",
    "0.25 cup butter, cut into pieces",
    "0.5 cup chopped pecans"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C.) Butter an 8-inch square baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Qx0fD4tMj8Kv22Lofo5x8mcCA1g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-41893-apple-cranberry-crisp-VAT-4x3-step-01-47e23d6f1ef2415dacf10859f550f178.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/41893/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix apples, cranberries, white sugar, cinnamon, and nutmeg in a large bowl. Place in an even layer in the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/juMT9HRy5F9RaJNS-ITYkI04yNM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-41893-apple-cranberry-crisp-VAT-4x3-step-02-b224cb9be5e64ca7be1b56b4e89c0e90.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/41893/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the same bowl, combine oats, flour, and brown sugar for topping. Add butter pieces and mix with a fork until crumbly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rAa31aMExTvLZIkJ8mvXOSgGHDw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-41893-apple-cranberry-crisp-VAT-4x3-step-03-3277094d7de842e1bb43c9ee5cd81ea3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/41893/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in pecans. Sprinkle topping over apples in the baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/O7z3nf-v9wb6-U6xC_71y-Fs9Qc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-41893-apple-cranberry-crisp-VAT-4x3-step-04-b-b5733e7a577248d98ea631e313e9a039.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/41893/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until apples are tender and topping is golden brown, 40 to 50 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EEuSsdlNwVeHkjyGqumzxJxc9jU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-41893-apple-cranberry-crisp-VAT-4x3-step-05-db74a066e603493386936342abf57bce.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/41893/step_05.webp"
    }
